{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>His blood, it is in his life.</b> His blood serves him in place of the life — for the life depends on it." "<b>For the life of all flesh, it is its blood.</b> The life is the blood. דָּם and בָּשָׂר are masculine; נֶפֶשׁ is feminine."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:54.022107846Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}